XDJ-RX: i.MX6 peripheral fixes the firmware needs.

  - imx6_src.c: self-clearing GPU reset bits (galcore waits for them); boot-mode
    straps SBMR1 from xdj_src_sbmr1() (weak; SD vs NAND u-boot env, xdj-board.c).
  - imx_gpt.c/.h + imx6_ccm.c: imx_gpt_kick() and a DVFS clock-step hook
    (xdj_dvfs_gpt_kick, hw/arm/xdj/xdj-display.c) so the bus-frequency settling
    wait completes.
  - imx_gpio.c/.h: "psr-reset" property -- per-bank pad levels at reset (keys and
    fault lines idle HIGH, the update-mode strap).
  - imx_spi.c: call xdj_subucom_frame_start() (weak) at the start of every ECSPI
    burst so the front-panel MCU frame is presented byte-aligned.
(Replaces the old patches 01, 04, 05 and the imx_spi.c part of 14.)

